    <string name="about_library_developers">By %1$s</string>
    <string name="about_open_source_stack">Core stack: Wear Compose 1.6.2, Navigation 2.9.8, Backdrop 2.0.1, Horologist 0.7.15, Room 2.8.4, Hilt 2.60, KotlinX, Coroutines, AboutLibraries, and MaterialKolor. The license screen is generated from build dependencies.</string>
    <string name="about_changelog_title">3.5.1 highlights</string>
    <string name="about_changelog_expand_hint">Tap to expand</string>
    <string name="about_changelog">
        " · Fixed the navigation black scrim that hid theme / fluid / custom-image backgrounds\n"
        " · Fluid backgrounds now use regional average tones instead of four single pixels\n"
        " · Capped per-card live blur cost and uses a lightweight material on inactive pages\n"
        " · Keeps dispersion, lens distortion, and soft / balanced / fluid profiles functional\n"
        " · Removed eager Tile data work from the Wear cold-start path\n"
        " · Delayed China Wear Data Layer bootstrap until the first UI has settled\n"
        " · Refreshes Tile and complications immediately after local timetable edits\n"
        " · Keeps Tile Timeline as the primary time-bound update path with periodic refresh as fallback\n"
        " · Added a live progress bar to the current-class card without continuous animation\n"
        " · Added a richer Today timetable section on mobile with course-color emphasis\n"
        " · Shows current/total semester week when an end date is available\n"
        " · Preserved Hybrid Data Layer, China legacy fallback, and existing signing configuration"
    </string>
